[{"id":167949277,"discussion_id":"59a670dd6cf1e6399c06c093a67a9cb9c694a9c7","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| repo-cann/ops-math | ✅ [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111), [*wangrui_*](https://gitcode.com/wangrui_) (2/2) | ✅ [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n BruceLP, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-10T16:19:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-13T14:23:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167949469,"discussion_id":"2a1ae050089727e2f61b252ee815a6211a90da8b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要修复TopK算子中的两个关键问题。一是修复排序模式下参数设置逻辑，原代码将布尔值直接赋值给内核参数，可能导致内核解析错误，影响排序结果的正确性。二是修复内核代码中的局部张量内存管理问题，原循环外分配、循环内复用的模式可能导致内存泄漏或访问已释放内存，存在稳定性风险。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n针对排序参数问题，通过引入`CONST_ZERO`常量，将排序方向的布尔值映射为明确的数值（降序为2，升序为0），确保内核能正确解析意图。针对内存管理问题，将局部张量的分配与释放操作移入循环体内部，每次迭代独立分配并立即释放，遵循“分配-使用-释放”的清晰模式，消除了跨迭代的内存管理风险。两项修改均不涉及外部接口或新增依赖，属于内部逻辑优化。","created_at":"2026-04-10T16:19:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-10T16:19:54+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168031089,"discussion_id":"af7b1d703c8556cffff11b153ab45e4af20dc5ab","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-11T16:10:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-11T16:10:09+08:00","user":{"id":"68ca5a21d94db731d1dc62ac","login":"BruceLP","object_id":"68ca5a21d94db731d1dc62ac","name":"BruceLP","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/cc/ba/63c4cb2a1a72a875363a35528473db370334011a24789dea98fcded9414ac801.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/BruceLP"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168031235,"discussion_id":"7533fceda1364d650b58357c593cf2eb86772834","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4a243b02d4dd4e5dad9d292c8ac8560e&pipelineRunId=1b93bc200ce247228a6945320e785546&projectName=CANN'>1b93bc200ce247228a6945320e785546</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4a243b02d4dd4e5dad9d292c8ac8560e&pipelineRunId=1b93bc200ce247228a6945320e785546&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-math/package/2175/cann-ops-math_linux-